## Model card

- **Name:** Ling 3.0 Flash Sante (InclusionAI)
- **Short description:** Health and medicine-specialized mixture-of-experts model built on Ling 3.0 Flash, 124B total / ~5.1B active parameters, 262K context, 32K max output; MIT license; released 2026-09-04. Specialized for medical reasoning and evidence-based retrieval; retains general reasoning, coding, and agentic capabilities of Ling 3.0 Flash.
- **Provider / access:** Vercel AI Gateway (inclusionai/ling-3-0-flash-sante-free, free), OpenRouter.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released 2026-09-04; knowledge cutoff not stated.
- **IDs:** `inclusionai/ling-3.0-flash-sante` (OpenCode), `inclusionai/ling-3.0-flash-sante-free` (Vercel AI Gateway).
- **Context window:** 262,000 tokens (opencode.ai; Vercel). Verified.
- **Modalities:** Text in, text out (text-only — NOT multimodal); reasoning yes; tool calls yes; structured output not explicitly advertised.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-16):** $0.07/M input, $0.22/M output, $0.01/M cached input (opencode.ai); free on Vercel AI Gateway.
- **Architecture:** 124B total / ~5.1B active MoE, inherits Ling-3.0-flash hybrid-linear architecture; fine-tuned on medical data.

